#ASSERT `o 18 r 5(4) the appellate Court may impose conditions, including ordering the intervening party to provide security for costs` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 18 r 6(1) the appeal operates as a stay of enforcement or of proceedings under the decision of the lower Court` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 18 r 6(1) the appeal operates as a stay of enforcement or of proceedings under the decision of the lower Court` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- "Except so far as ... otherwise direct"
#ASSERT `o 18 r 6(2) an intermediate act or proceeding is invalidated by the appeal` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 18 r 6(2) an intermediate act or proceeding is invalidated by the appeal` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
